  <releases>
    <release version="0.6.0" date="2026-10-02">
      <description>
        <p>Word files now read like books, and the library has more of your own shape in it.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>A .docx opens as flowing text or page-for-page, and a highlight made in one mode is still there in the other</li>
          <li>The Continue Reading card comes in four styles</li>
          <li>Focus mode on desktop: the page, and your progress as a thin rail along the top</li>
          <li>Books open in scroll mode, and your place survives a layout switch</li>
          <li>Resizing the window and going full screen are smooth</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
